// Supabase Postgres database module for LawTech
// Switch this app from SQLite to a managed Postgres database via the
// Supabase platform. Set up via Supabase Dashboard.
//
// Get these from your Supabase project:
//   SUPABASE_URL      https://<project>.supabase.co
//   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY sb_pub...      (anon / publishable key)
//   JWT_SECRET        your own signing secret for LawTech sessions
//   ADMIN_EMAIL       initial admin email
//   ADMIN_PASSWORD    initial admin password
//
// If SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY are missing, the app refuses to start so
// you never ship an unconfigured database driver.
